r($conn,$L1,'Am thuc Trung Hoa','中国是一个美食大国，各地有各的特色。北方人喜欢吃面条、饺子和馒头，口味偏咸。南方人喜欢吃米饭，口味偏清淡。四川人喜欢吃辣的，重庆火锅非常有名。广东人喜欢喝汤，他们的汤又营养又好喝。在中国，吃饭不仅是为了填饱肚子，更是一种文化交流。朋友聚会、家庭团圆都离不开一桌好菜。如果你来中国旅游，一定要尝尝各地的美食。','Zhong guo shi yi ge mei shi da guo, ge di you ge de te se. Bei fang ren xi huan chi mian tiao、jiao zi he man tou, kou wei pian xian. Nan fang ren xi huan chi mi fan, kou wei pian qing dan. Si chuan ren xi huan chi la de, Chong qing huo guo fei chang you ming. Guang dong ren xi huan he tang, ta men de tang you ying yang you hao he. Zai Zhong guo, chi fan bu jin shi wei le tian bao du zi, geng shi yi zhong wen hua jiao liu. Peng you ju hui、jia ting tuan yuan dou li bu kai yi zhuo hao cai. Ru guo ni lai Zhong guo lv you, yi ding yao chang chang ge di de mei shi.','TQ la dat nuoc am thuc, moi noi co net rieng. Mien Bac thich mi, banh chao. Nam thich com, thanh dam. Tu Xuyen thich cay, lau Trung Kinh noi tieng. Quang Dong thich sup, vua bo vua ngon. An o TQ ko chi de no ma la giao luu van hoa. Gap go ban be, sum hop gia dinh deu can com ngon. Du lich TQ nho nem dac san moi noi.','medium',180,1);
$L1l=l($conn,$L1,'Am thuc','A: Ban da an mon TQ gi chua? B: An vit quay Bac Kinh va lau Trung Kinh. A: Thich mon nao nhat? B: Vit quay, mac du lau cung ngon. A: Co dinh hoc nau ko? B: Co, toi muon hoc nau mon TQ.','A: Ni chi guo Zhong guo cai ma? B: Chi guo Bei jing kao ya he Chong qing huo guo. A: Ni zui xi huan na ge? B: Kao ya, sui ran huo guo ye hen hao chi. A: Ni da suan xue zuo Zhong guo cai ma? B: Shi de, wo xiang xue.','A: Ban da an mon TQ gi? B: An vit quay BK va lau TK. A: Thich mon nao nhat? B: Vit quay, du lau cung ngon. A: Dinh hoc nau ko? B: Co, toi muon hoc.','1');
