r($conn,$L3,'Ko can giam can','最近很多年轻人都想减肥。他们觉得自己太胖了，其实他们并不胖。健康比瘦更重要。如果为了减肥而不吃饭，对身体反而不好。其实只要每天坚持运动，少吃油炸食品，就能保持健康的身体。运动不一定要去健身房，走路、跑步、游泳都是很好的运动方式。我有一个朋友，她从来不减肥，但是她每天坚持走路一个小时，身体一直很健康。所以，不要过分担心体重，健康快乐才是最重要的。','Zui jin hen duo nian qing ren dou xiang jian fei. Ta men jue de zi ji tai pang le, qi shi ta men bing bu pang. Jian kang bi shou geng zhong yao. Ru guo wei le jian fei er bu chi fan, dui shen ti fan er bu hao. Qi shi zhi yao mei tian jian chi yun dong, shao chi you zha shi pin, jiu neng bao chi jian kang de shen ti. Yun dong bu yi ding yao qu jian shen fang, zou lu、pao bu、you yong dou shi hen hao de yun dong fang shi. Wo you yi ge peng you, ta cong lai bu jian fei, dan shi ta mei tian jian chi zou lu yi ge xiao shi, shen ti yi zhi hen jian kang. Suo yi, bu yao guo fen dan xin ti zhong, jian kang kuai le cai shi zui zhong yao de.','Nhieu nguoi tre muon giam can. Ho thay minh beo, nhung thuc ra ko beo. Suc khoe quan trong hon gay. Neu nhip an de giam can se hai co the. Chi can tap moi ngay, an it do chien ran la giu suc khoe. Tap ko can den phong gym, di bo, chay, boi deu tot. Toi co ban ko bao gio giam can nhung di bo moi ngay, suc khoe tot. Dung lo can nang qua, suc khoe va vui ve moi quan trong.','medium',195,1);
$L3l=l($conn,$L3,'Giam can','A: Ban hinh nhu gay hon. B: That a? Toi dang giam can. A: Lam sao? B: An it va tap nhieu. Toi chay bo moi toi, chay ngay cang nhanh. A: Hieu qua? B: Giam duoc 3kg, tu tin hon.','A: Ni zui jin hao xiang shou le. B: Shi ma? Wo zheng zai jian fei. A: Ni zen me jian? B: Shao chi duo yun dong. Wo mei tian wan shang pao bu, pao de yue lai yue kuai. A: Xiao guo zen me yang? B: Jian le san gong jin, yue lai yue you zi xin.','A: Ban hinh nhu gay hon. B: That a? Toi dang giam can. A: Lam sao? B: An it va tap nhieu. Toi chay bo moi toi, chay ngay cang nhanh. A: Hieu qua? B: Giam duoc 3kg, tu tin hon.','1');
