r($conn,$L5,'HP la gi','很多人都问：幸福是什么？其实幸福没有标准答案。对不同的人来说，幸福有不同的样子。对饥饿的人来说，幸福是一碗热饭；对生病的人来说，幸福是健康的身体；对孤独的人来说，幸福是家人的陪伴。其实幸福就在我们身边，只是我们有时候没有发现。每天早上醒来，看到阳光，听到鸟叫，这就是幸福。和朋友一起吃饭聊天，这也是幸福。幸福不需要很多钱，也不需要多伟大的成就。只要学会满足和感恩，每天都可以是幸福的。珍惜现在拥有的一切，你会发现幸福其实很简单。','Hen duo ren dou wen: xing fu shi shen me? Qi shi xing fu mei you biao zhun da an. Dui bu tong de ren lai shuo, xing fu you bu tong de yang zi. Dui ji e de ren lai shuo, xing fu shi yi wan re fan; dui sheng bing de ren lai shuo, xing fu shi jian kang de shen ti; dui gu du de ren lai shuo, xing fu shi jia ren de pei ban. Qi shi xing fu jiu zai wo men shen bian, zhi shi wo men you shi hou mei you fa xian. Mei tian zao shang xing lai, kan dao yang guang, ting dao niao jiao, zhe jiu shi xing fu. He peng you yi qi chi fan liao tian, zhe ye shi xing fu. Xing fu bu xu yao hen duo qian, ye bu xu yao duo wei da de cheng jiu. Zhi yao xue hui man zu he gan en, mei tian dou ke yi shi xing fu de. Zhen xi xian zai yong you de yi qie, ni hui fa xian xing fu qi shi hen jian dan.','Nhieu nguoi hoi HP la gi? Ko co dap an chuan. Voi nguoi doi, HP la bat com nong. Voi nguoi om, HP la suc khoe. Voi nguoi co don, HP la gia dinh. HP ben ta, nhung ta ko nhan ra. Sang thuc day thay nang nghe chim hot la HP. An cung ban be la HP. HP ko can nhieu tien hay thanh tuu lon. Chi can thoa man va biet on, moi ngay deu co the HP. Tran trong nhung gi co, ban se thay HP that don gian.','medium',220,1);
$L5l=l($conn,$L5,'HP','A: HP la gi? B: Voi toi, HP la duoc song vui ve. A: Ban co cam thay HP ko? B: Co. Toi co gia dinh yeu thuong va ban be tot. A: The con tien bac? B: Quan trong nhung ko phai tat ca.','A: Xing fu shi shen me? B: Dui wo lai shuo, xing fu jiu shi kuai le de sheng huo. A: Ni gan dao xing fu ma? B: Shi de. Wo you ai wo de jia ren he hao peng you. A: Na qian ne? B: Hen zhong yao, dan bu shi quan bu.','A: HP la gi? B: Voi toi, HP la song vui. A: Ban thay HP ko? B: Co. Toi co gia dinh yeu va ban tot. A: Con tien? B: Quan trong nhung ko phai tat ca.','1');
